{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Scrap Paper Pro 是一款刻意不像筆記系統的速記工具：沒有記事本、沒有資料夾、沒有標題與標籤，只有一頁畫布。它適合只想隨手把念頭寫下、不願花時間整理歸檔的人。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>一頁到底的極簡速記畫布</h2>\n<p>Scrap Paper Pro 只有一頁畫布，隨手記下的內容落在同一頁，開啟時自動回到上次停筆的位置，鍵盤已就緒。經個人 iCloud 帳戶，頁面在 iPhone、iPad 與 Apple Watch 之間私人同步；小工具可顯示最新數行或一按開始聽寫，Siri 亦可免持記錄。支援 Apple Intelligence 的裝置可掃描頁面，把內容化成日曆事件或提醒事項。無帳號、無伺服器、無廣告，一次購買，無訂閱。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-161-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-162-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-163-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-164-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-165-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-166-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Scrap Paper Pro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T04:21:06.996632+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":393,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}